"P1587003269" "<t=5 caption x=0.5 y=0.5 d=5><scale 1.75><color White><bgcolor DarkGreen>This is Mr. G. It appears the man with the codes has been captured by the IDF.<t=5 caption x=0.5 y=0.5 d=5><scale 1.75><color White><bgcolor DarkGreen>The IDF are desperate, but they aren't your enemies. Perhaps you could strike a bargain with them? Yes, perhaps a bargain would be in order."
// Script Variable Caption :
"P2644115085" "<t=5 caption x=0.7 y=0.7 d=5><scale 1.75><color White><bgcolor DarkRed>YO! {HeroName}! What is UP! It's me, Dean MacArthur!<t=5 caption x=0.7 y=0.7 d=5><scale 1.75><color White><bgcolor DarkRed>What're you up to? It's been too long! We gotta catch up!<t=5 caption x=0.7 y=0.7 d=5><scale 1.75><color White><bgcolor DarkRed>I figure, you must be busy, but check it out. Before you go off on your next task, you should totally give me a ring!"
