// Script Variable INACTIVE_DIALOG_MINION1 :
"P1031088448" "Anything to report?"
// Script Variable INACTIVE_DIALOG_MINION2 :
"P2170714839" "<t=2 d=2><t=5 d=5>Everything is going. The helicopter is unloading now."
// Script Variable ATTACK_DIALOG_MINION1 :
"P759143891" "We've got a villain here, it's {HeroName}!"
// Script Variable INACTIVE_DIALOG_MINION1 :
"P900611992" "Do we know where Battle Maiden is?"
// Script Variable INACTIVE_DIALOG_MINION2 :
"P2514939104" "<t=2 d=2><t=5 d=5>No idea. All we know is that we had a Malta mole in Vanguard."
// Script Variable INACTIVE_DIALOG_MINION1 :
"P626820887" "Why did we just let the Praetorian Yins go to the Rogue Isles? We could use their help in Paragon."
// Script Variable INACTIVE_DIALOG_MINION2 :
"P501710093" "<t=2 d=2><t=5 d=5>Word is that Wu Yin and Penelope want to clean up the mess in the Isles."
// Script Variable INACTIVE_DIALOG_MINION1 :
"P76257996" "Do we have any information on Wu Yin and the Syndicate?"
// Script Variable INACTIVE_DIALOG_MINION2 :
"P3821663938" "<t=2 d=2><t=5 d=5>Gaussian sent out a report that the Yin family went to the Rogue Isles."
// Script Variable INACTIVE_DIALOG_MINION1 :
"P1371378040" "That Transmuter guy is a joke! Why do we have him imprisoned here?"
// Script Variable INACTIVE_DIALOG_MINION2 :
"P1348970878" "<t=2 d=2><t=5 d=5>I read his file. He was a powerhouse, back in the day, fought in the Hamidon Wars. If he got his powers back, we'd be in trouble."
// Script Variable INACTIVE_DIALOG_MINION1 :
"P2492235168" "How worried should we be about Bobcat? I saw the reports of her in Neutropolis."
// Script Variable INACTIVE_DIALOG_MINION2 :
"P2038414653" "<t=2 d=2><t=5 d=5>If we get her angry? Very worried. But as long as she's calm, we have nothing to worry about."
// Script Variable INACTIVE_DIALOG_MINION1 :
"P3867385827" "Didn't Splice help with the attack on BAF?"
// Script Variable INACTIVE_DIALOG_MINION2 :
"P4002754504" "<t=2 d=2><t=5 d=5>She did, but she has to answer for all her other crimes."
